                "tldr": "McCluskey et al. as discussed by the authors found that high-risk youth struggle with complex issues and circumstances related to childhood maltreatment, caregiver issues, unhealthy environments, and difficulties with social adjustment, all of which can lead to poor educational performance and delinquent, sometimes violent, behavior.",
