                "source": "scispace_full_text",
                "relevance_summary": "Uses prison mental health care experiences to examine inmate needs, voice, and service gaps; provides direct insights into mental health status and preferences, but lacks education or age\u2011entry analysis and cross\u2011jurisdiction comparison.",
                "relevance_metadata": {
