                "tldr": "More research is warranted regarding the access, quality, and efficiency of mental health care in Ontario prisons, and how factors including ethnicity, gender, and prison classification may influence mental health care and its outcomes.",
                "podcast": null,
                "podcast_generation_allowed": true,
                "entity_type": "PAPER",
                "rank": 8,
                "relevance_data": {},
                "source": "scispace",
                "relevance_summary": "Uses Ontario prison data to map mental health service access and quality, directly addressing incarcerated adults. Lacks education or age\u2011entry analysis, touches on inmate voice via collaboration needs, and includes limited needs assessment of mental health services.",
                "relevance_metadata": {
                    "criteria_judgments": [
