            "relevance_3LNXgq": "- **Relevance Score:** 58/100\n- **Relevance Tag:** Somewhat Relevant\n- **Reasoning:** Uses extensive inmate mental\u2011health data to evaluate reentry programs; focuses on current prisoners, their psychological needs, and limited advocacy aspects, but lacks education, age\u2011entry, and cross\u2011jurisdiction comparisons.",
