            "relevance_3LNXgq": "- **Relevance Score:** 57/100\n- **Relevance Tag:** Somewhat Relevant\n- **Reasoning:** Uses Life History Calendar to examine mental illness pathways of female inmates, highlighting criminogenic risk across life course. Does not address education levels, systematic needs assessments, or rights advocacy, and only loosely touches on age of entry.",
