            "relevance_3LNXgq": "- **Relevance Score:** 56/100\n- **Relevance Tag:** Somewhat Relevant\n- **Reasoning:** Uses prison context to argue for broader postsecondary opportunities, highlights inmate voice and advocacy, examines degree pathways, but lacks age\u2011entry data, mental\u2011health focus, and systematic needs assessment.",
