                "tldr": "This article explored the relationship between educational attainment, adult cognitive skill proficiency, lifelong learning, and social outcomes among incarcerated individuals and found that at least one of the three types of human capital variables included was positively and significantly related to the three social outcomes of political efficacy, interpersonal trust, and health perception.",
                "podcast": null,
