            "relevance_3LNXgq": "- **Relevance Score:** 51/100\n- **Relevance Tag:** Somewhat Relevant\n- **Reasoning:** Uses prison\u2011based higher\u2011education case studies to critique recidivism\u2011focused policies, highlights inmate voices and advocacy, but lacks age\u2011entry pathways and mental\u2011health analysis.",
