                "relevance_summary": "Uses longitudinal data on former inmates to predict re\u2011incarceration; analyzes age at first prison entry as a key predictor; focuses on recidivism rather than education, rights, or cross\u2011jurisdictional comparison; touches on addiction as a mental\u2011health factor but does not evaluate treatment services or inmate preferences.",
