                ],
                "rank": 29,
                "relevance_data": {},
                "source": "scispace_full_text",
                "relevance_summary": "Uses respectful, stigma\u2011free language to promote dignity of incarcerated people; calls for advocacy and rights\u2011focused communication. Mentions mental\u2011health professionals and values\u2011clarification workshops, hinting at wellbeing and preference considerations, but lacks direct education, age\u2011entry, or cross\u2011jurisdiction analyses.",
