            "relevance_3LNXgq": "- **Relevance Score:** 50/100\n- **Relevance Tag:** Somewhat Relevant\n- **Reasoning:** Uses a large inmate sample to validate a correctional screening tool and report mental illness prevalence, directly addressing prison mental health; does not cover education, entry age, or rights advocacy.",
