                "snippet": "\u2026 therapies with mental health outcomes in prisoners and qualitatively \u2026 therapies with mental health outcomes in prisoners (37 \u2026 are no existing psychological treatment programs. However, \u2026",
                "rank": 9,
                "relevance_data": {},
                "relevance_summary": "Uses systematic review and meta\u2011analysis to evaluate CBT and mindfulness therapies for depression and anxiety in prisoners, directly addressing mental health outcomes in an incarcerated sample.",
                "relevance_metadata": {
                    "criteria_judgments": [
                        {
                            "criterion_name": "Incarcerated Population Focus",
                            "relevance": "Perfectly Relevant"
                        },
                        {
                            "criterion_name": "Educational Attainment of Prisoners",
                            "relevance": "Not Relevant"
                        },
                        {
                            "criterion_name": "Age at Incarceration Entry and Pathways",
                            "relevance": "Not Relevant"
                        },
                        {
                            "criterion_name": "Prisoner Rights, Voice, and Advocacy",
                            "relevance": "Not Relevant"
