                "tldr": "Andersen et al. as discussed by the authors found that lifetime prevalence rates of mental disorders, including substance-related disorders and personality disorders, were found to be 71% in Denmark (Andersen, Sestoft, Lillebaek, Gabrielsen, & Kramp, 1996) and 72% in England (Birmingham, Mason, & Grubin, 1996).",
