            "relevance_3LNXgq": "- **Relevance Score:** 48/100\n- **Relevance Tag:** Marginally Relevant\n- **Reasoning:** Uses incarcerated women sample to profile substance use, health, and mental health problems; reports mental health prevalence and limited treatment use, indicating strong relevance to mental health outcomes. Provides a needs assessment of service utilization but lacks education, entry age, rights advocacy, or cross\u2011jurisdiction comparisons.",
