            "relevance_3LNXgq": "- **Relevance Score:** 47/100\n- **Relevance Tag:** Marginally Relevant\n- **Reasoning:** Uses inmate GED outcomes to examine race, age, gender effects; directly studies incarcerated learners and their education levels. Mentions age demographics but not entry pathways. No focus on rights, advocacy, or mental health.",
