            "relevance_3LNXgq": "- **Relevance Score:** 47/100\n- **Relevance Tag:** Marginally Relevant\n- **Reasoning:** Uses prisoner narratives to explore criminal pathways, giving inmates a voice; directly studies incarcerated adults but does not address education levels, mental health, or cross\u2011jurisdiction comparisons.",
