                "metrics": {
                    "citations": {
                        "total": null
                    }
                },
                "tldr": "For example, this paper found that 75% of all U.S. prisoners had not completed high school and only 25% of the general population had completed high education, compared with 50-65% of those who had not attended high school at all.",
