            "relevance_3LNXgq": "- **Relevance Score:** 41/100\n- **Relevance Tag:** Marginally Relevant\n- **Reasoning:** Uses policy analysis to argue for college access for current/former inmates; cites recidivism data and workforce needs, but lacks detailed education level, age\u2011entry, mental\u2011health, or cross\u2011jurisdiction comparisons.",
