            "relevance_3LNXgq": "- **Relevance Score:** 41/100\n- **Relevance Tag:** Marginally Relevant\n- **Reasoning:** Uses Indigenous prison context to highlight education barriers and cultural needs; discusses access and support but lacks detailed attainment data, age\u2011entry analysis, mental\u2011health focus, or cross\u2011jurisdiction comparison.",
