                "tldr": "This article explored the relationship between education and specific chronic and infectious health conditions among the currently incarcerated and found that while education may play a lesser role for chronic conditions for the incarcerated, it can still be important for avoiding risky health behaviors.",
                "podcast": null,
                "podcast_generation_allowed": true,
                "entity_type": "PAPER",
