                "title": "We Are Not Slaves: Rethinking the Rise of Carceral States through the Lens of the Prisoners' Rights Movement",
                "is_archived": false,
                "full_slug": "we-are-not-slaves-rethinking-the-rise-of-carceral-states-yz3fewzrho",
                "journal": {
                    "display_name": "The Journal of American History",
