                "tldr": "In this article, the authors examined the barriers to higher education encountered, the social and human capital attained, and former prisoners' experiences during both incarceration and higher education, and found that participating in higher education had a positive impact on the reintegration experience of those formerly incarcerated individuals.",
                "podcast": null,
                "podcast_generation_allowed": true,
