            "papers_Knp69H": {
                "id": 2593142038,
                "title": "\u2018La administraci\u00f3n del castigo': El sentido de las l\u00f3gicas burocr\u00e1ticas en el Servicio Penitenciario Federal Argentino",
                "is_archived": false,
                "full_slug": "la-administracion-del-castigo-el-sentido-de-las-logicas-1jwiq1uxgv",
                "journal": null,
                "conference_series": null,
                "date": "2015-10-01 00:00:00+00:00",
                "is_oa": true,
                "publication_type": null,
                "doi": null,
                "unique_id": "1jwiq1uxgv",
                "abstract": "Este artigo se debruca sobre as logicas burocraticas adotadas pelo Servico Penitenciario Federal Argentino, instituicao legitimada pelo Estado para conceder \u201ctratamento\u201d com vista a \u201creinsercao social\u201d, mas tambem castigo aqueles que se separaram das normas legais e que, por esse motivo, se encontram na prisao. A possibilidade de mergulhar nas ditas praticas, relacionadas ao particular apego do pessoal penitenciario pelo registro, controle e cuidado das rotinas diarias e expedientes que circulam nas unidades carcerarias, permite falar das formas adotadas pelo poder em um espaco de administracao por parte do Estado, mas tambem como o lugar do castigo e da pena. This article focuses on the bureaucratic logics ad\u00c2\u00adopted by the Argentine Federal Penitentiary Service, an institution legitimized by the State to grant \u201ctreat\u00c2\u00adment\u201d for \u201csocial reintegration\u201d, but also punishment for those who have departed from the legal norms and who, for this reason, was sent to prison. The possibility of immersing in these practices, related to the particular attachment of prison staff to the formal registry, control and care with the daily rou\u00c2\u00adtines and expedients circulating in the prison units, allows to talk about the forms adopted by the power in an administration space of the State, but also as a setting of punishment and punishment. Keywords: punishment, penitentiary treatment, bureaucratic practices, penitentiary personnel, Argentina",
                "authors": {
                    "total": 1,
                    "data": [
                        {
                            "display_name": "Natalia Soledad Ojeda",
                            "id": 2688920474,
                            "slug": "natalia-soledad-ojeda",
                            "unique_id": "1p0qeqi4tu",
                            "full_slug": "natalia-soledad-ojeda-1p0qeqi4tu"
                        }
                    ]
                },
