                "is_oa": null,
                "publication_type": "Journal Article",
                "doi": "10.56083/rcv5n5-123",
                "unique_id": "xyb1yje3zff6",
                "abstract": "A educa\u00e7\u00e3o no sistema prisional \u00e9 uma ferramenta essencial para a reinser\u00e7\u00e3o social dos detentos. Esta pesquisa analisa sua efic\u00e1cia na redu\u00e7\u00e3o da reincid\u00eancia criminal e na promo\u00e7\u00e3o da cidadania. Considerando a Lei de Execu\u00e7\u00e3o Penal e tratados internacionais, este estudo investiga desafios e impactos da educa\u00e7\u00e3o prisional, al\u00e9m de apresentar experi\u00eancias bem-sucedidas no Brasil e no exterior. A falta de infraestrutura e a escassez de professores qualificados s\u00e3o apontadas como barreiras para a expans\u00e3o e aprimoramento dessas iniciativas. ",
                "authors": {
                    "total": 1,
                    "data": [
                        {
                            "display_name": "Cristiani Andre da Silva",
                            "full_slug": null
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "affiliations": {
                    "total": 0,
                    "data": []
                },
                "is_fulltext_request_allowed": false,
                "metrics": {
                    "citations": {
                        "total": null
                    }
                },
                "tldr": "This study examines the effectiveness of education in Brazilian prisons in reducing recidivism and promoting citizenship, highlighting challenges, successes, and international best practices, while also addressing infrastructure and teacher shortages as barriers to expansion.",
                "podcast": null,
                "podcast_generation_allowed": true,
                "entity_type": "PAPER",
                "rank": 19,
