            "relevance_3LNXgq": "- **Relevance Score:** 31/100\n- **Relevance Tag:** Marginally Relevant\n- **Reasoning:** Uses community college programs to educate incarcerated students, detailing curricular challenges and workforce preparation; touches on student needs but lacks focus on mental health, rights, age entry, or cross\u2011jurisdiction comparisons.",
