                "tldr": "Cnaan et al. as mentioned in this paper introduced a two-semester MSW curriculum that infuses social work education with issues relating to mass incarceration and it's various intersections with social work practice.",
                "podcast": null,
                "podcast_generation_allowed": true,
                "entity_type": "PAPER",
                "score": 0.46832922,
