                        "Html": [
                            "https://eric.ed.gov/?id=ED523285",
                            "http://publications.sreb.org/2011/11S06_Focus_Incarceration.pdf"
                        ]
                    },
                    "is_show": true
                },
                "metrics": {
                    "citations": {
                        "total": null
                    }
                },
                "tldr": "The authors of as mentioned in this paper looked at adults with criminal records as an underserved population who might benefit greatly from educational services, as would the states where they live, and they found that the overall educational attainment of inmates and the formerly incarcerated is considerably below that of the general population.",
