            "relevance_3LNXgq": "- **Relevance Score:** 7/100\n- **Relevance Tag:** Not Relevant\n- **Reasoning:** Maps incarceration concepts across generations; offers generational lenses but lacks direct data on prisoners, education, rights, or mental\u2011health outcomes.",
