            "relevance_3LNXgq": "- **Relevance Score:** 0/100\n- **Relevance Tag:** Not Relevant\n- **Reasoning:** Analyzes sentencing disparities by race, age, and sex using Florida conviction data; does not examine incarcerated individuals' experiences, education, health, rights, or needs.",
